  "final_message": "Failed payments were never retried because of a status typo in `due_for_retry` in `billing/dunning.py`. It filtered invoices with `status == \"opened\"`, but the real status is `\"open\"` (see `InvoiceStatus` in `models.py`). No invoice ever matched, so nothing was due for retry. The invoice stayed open with a past `next_attempt_at`, and the subscription stayed `past_due`.\n\nI changed the filter to `\"open\"`. The 24 existing tests pass, but I didn't add a test that covers this retry path.\n\nI also wrote `answer.json` with `{\"file\": \"dunning.py\", \"function\": \"due_for_retry\"}`.",
